<title>USA: Sarasota Cty, Fla., $41 mln repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Sarasota Cty, Fla., $41 mln repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
